{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103570","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103570","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710357001:1":{"text":"...알라인? 그리고... 카이로렌 백작까지. 여기서 뭘 하고 있는 거죠?","source_cn":"……阿莱茵馆长？还有……凯洛伦夫人？你们在做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x231C7FE2A83C05C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710357002:1":{"text":"세상에, 공주님...! 듀라 님이시여, 오늘 이게 대체 무슨 일인가요!","source_cn":"呜呜……公主殿下！艾雅啊！这到底是什么倒霉日子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD23F8E40E84B1EB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710357003:1":{"text":"오전에는 축제에서 웬 원숭이한테 핸드백을 뺏기질 않나, 겨우 침실로 돌아갔더니 이번엔...","source_cn":"上午在庆典上被那只该死的猴子抢了包受了惊吓，好不容易回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2741A13901065077","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710357004:1":{"text":"눈을 떠보니까 이런 무시무시한 곳에 와있더군요!","source_cn":"结果眼睛一闭一睁，就到这种可怕的地方来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0740D877D4A9143","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710357005:1":{"text":"놀랐겠네요. 걱정 말아요. 이렇게 만났으니, 제가 끝까지 지켜드릴게요.","source_cn":"夫人受惊了。请放心，既然汇合了，我会护你周全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EB561A56FCB07F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":